  "rationales": {
    "U": "证据片段：'Composite Master Key To open a database you must use all key sources'。解释：需求以术语'Composite Master Key'开头，但未定义其含义，句子结构不完整，如'To open a database'未明确主语，影响整体理解性。",
    "A": "证据片段：'and/or Windows account details'。解释：'and/or'的使用引入了歧义，不确定是否必须同时使用所有密钥源（如密码、密钥文件和Windows账户详情）还是部分即可，导致需求解释模糊。",
    "C": "证据片段：'such as password, key file and/or Windows account details that were used when the Master Key was created'。解释：逻辑上，如果创建主密钥时使用了特定密钥源组合，需求中的'and/or'可能允许不完整验证，影响正确性，应指定必须所有密钥源。",
    "V": "证据片段：'you must use all key sources'。解释：需求陈述抽象，未定义'使用'的具体操作（如输入、验证）或成功标准，难以设计可执行的测试用例，影响可验证性。"
  },
  "suggestions": {
    "U": "To open a database protected by a Composite Master Key, the system must require the user to provide all key sources specified during Master Key creation. Key sources include password, key file, and Windows account details.",
    "A": "To open a database protected by a Composite Master Key, the system must require the user to provide all key sources specified during Master Key creation. Key sources include password, key file, and Windows account details, and all must be authenticated.",
    "C": "To open a database protected by a Composite Master Key, the system must require the user to provide all key sources that were configured during Master Key creation. Key sources include password, key file, and Windows account details, and authentication must succeed only when all are correct.",
    "V": "To open a database protected by a Composite Master Key, the system must require the user to provide all key sources specified during Master Key creation. The system shall verify each key source (password, key file, Windows account details) and grant access only if all verifications pass."
  },
