  "rationales": {"U":"'Composite Master Key To open a database you must use all key sources such as password, key file and/or Windows account details that were used when the Master Key was created.' 缺乏主语和动词结构，首词'Composite Master Key'孤立无谓语，句式杂糅（名词短语+祈使句+举例嵌套），且'etc.'类模糊列举未定义穷举性，导致读者需推测语法主干和适用范围；证据片段：'Composite Master Key To open...'开头无谓语，'such as... and/or...'中'and/or'引入逻辑歧义与覆盖不确定性","A":"'all key sources such as password, key file and/or Windows account details'中'such as'未声明是否为完备枚举，'and/or'在安全上下文中构成严重歧义——无法判定是否允许子集组合（如仅密码+key file）或强制全集；证据片段：'all key sources such as... and/or...'","C":"需求隐含'Composite Master Key'由多个源共同派生，但未明确该密钥是否真实存在为独立实体，也未说明'Windows account details'是用于NTLM认证、Kerberos票据还是凭据代理，技术上可能不成立（例如Windows账户细节通常不参与加密密钥派生）；证据片段：'Windows account details that were used when the Master Key was created'","V":"无可观测行为指标或判定条件：未定义'open a database'的具体成功/失败信号（如返回码、日志事件、UI状态）、未规定'used'的验证方式（是输入校验？还是运行时绑定？）、未给出任何测试用例边界（如缺1项时是否拒绝？错误码为何？）；证据片段：'you must use all key sources...'无前置条件、无后置断言、无否定场景描述"},
  "suggestions": {"U":"The system SHALL require the user to provide exactly the same set of authentication inputs that were supplied during Composite Master Key creation in order to successfully open the database.","A":"The system SHALL accept only the exact combination of input types (password, key file, Windows account credentials) that was registered at Composite Master Key creation time; no subset or superset is permitted.","C":"The system SHALL derive the Composite Master Key by cryptographically binding the password, key file content, and Windows user SID (obtained via SSPI) using HKDF-SHA256, with all three inputs mandatory during creation and verification.","V":"When the user attempts to open the database, the system SHALL return error code E_MASTERKEY_AUTH_REQUIRED (0x8009002F) if any one of the originally registered authentication inputs is missing or invalid; this behavior SHALL be verified by test case TC-MK-OPEN-01: omit password while providing key file and Windows credentials → observe E_MASTERKEY_AUTH_REQUIRED."},
